<!-- Lifted out of index.html on 2026-08-13.
     The cards were still scaffolding, and scaffolding in the served
     HTML is what a crawler records on its first visit. Hiding it in
     CSS would not have helped: display:none content is still in the
     document a crawler reads. Paste this straight back above the
     closing </div> of .slide-inner on slide 4 once the ten funders
     have real names, amounts, logos and one-line descriptions. -->
      <!-- Top-10 funders strip. Reuses the member card's classes on
           purpose: same .tm shell, same selection shine, same
           highlight-nearest-the-centre behaviour, just laid out along
           the other axis by makeCarousel({axis:'x'}) in app.js.
           CONTENT IS PLACEHOLDER — real company names, contribution
           amounts, logos and one-line descriptions still to come. -->
